{"id":69419,"date":"2025-10-13T08:32:01","date_gmt":"2025-10-13T07:32:01","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/?post_type=ajde_events&#038;p=69419"},"modified":"2026-10-27T15:02:26","modified_gmt":"2026-10-27T14:02:26","slug":"corrida-e-caminhada-de-sao-martinho","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/corrida-e-caminhada-de-sao-martinho\/","title":{"rendered":"3\u00aa Corrida e Caminhada de S\u00e3o Martinho 2026"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">3\u00aa Corrida e Caminhada de S\u00e3o Martinho 2026<\/span><\/h2><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>3\u00aa Corrida e Caminhada de S\u00e3o Martinho 2026<\/strong> realiza-se no dia <strong>8 de Novembro de 2026<\/strong> (Domingo), com partida agendada para as <strong>16:00<\/strong> na deslumbrante <strong>Faj\u00e3 Grande<\/strong>, no concelho das <strong>Lajes das Flores<\/strong> (A\u00e7ores). Inserida numa das paisagens mais deslumbrantes do arquip\u00e9lago e no ponto mais ocidental da Europa, esta prova junta a tradi\u00e7\u00e3o do S\u00e3o Martinho ao desporto ao ar livre.<\/p><p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">O programa do evento \u00e9 bastante inclusivo e adaptado a diferentes n\u00edveis, contando com provas de corrida de <strong>7.5 km<\/strong>, <strong>5 km<\/strong> e <strong>2.5 km<\/strong> (com escal\u00f5es dedicados desde os benjamins aos veteranos), al\u00e9m de uma <strong>Caminhada de 2.5 km<\/strong> para quem prefere desfrutar da natureza a um ritmo mais tranquilo. \u00c9 uma excelente oportunidade para correr com vista para as majestosas cascatas e a imensid\u00e3o do Oceano Atl\u00e2ntico.<\/p><\/div><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\"><h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2><ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\"><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data & Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">8 de Novembro de 2026 \u00e0s 16:10<\/span><\/li><li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-w